."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [2, "TemptressSchool85", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SchoolBFemale2B", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["This way you'll be able to give "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["me proper one on one lessons and\\|\\^"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Secretary157", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 232, "parameters": [2, null, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0, 30, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SchoolAFemale2", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...so long as you keep providing what"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I want, I might even put in a good word"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["with the boss."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SchoolBMale2", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...Anabeth? Wait, I thought I was..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [2, "Secretary272", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 232, "parameters": [1, null, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0, 60, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SchoolAFemale2", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...perhaps one day you can call me that,"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["but for now it's Ms. Woods and nothing "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["else. Understand?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SchoolBMale2", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yes Ms Woods..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SchoolAFemale2", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Good, now you're going to lay still and "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["be a good boy while I-\\|\\^"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "TemptressNurse209", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 232, "parameters": [2, null, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 0, 30, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Nurse Pink Faceset", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...relieve you of any excess fluids."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Alright Mason?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Shrine Boy 2", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sure Abbi...\\.but wasn't I just-\\|\\^"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Nurse Pink Faceset", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Shh, just let me do all the work..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["This is who you are now.\\. Well, whoever you are "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["right now. Trapped in an endless cycle of nightmares "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["controlled at the whim of the succubi."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Every attempt to resist or escape results in you "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["being shoved into the background, forced to "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["perform as 'expected'.\\. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Who knows what's happening to your body, or "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["anything else in the 'real world'. All you know"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["is what you're told to know, the backgrounds, the"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["desires, the emotions of your 'characters'."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["All for someone's amusement...\\.Amarya? Alaru? Robin?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Who can say who's watching..."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 2, 1]}